"\n"
"|company| specializes in Odoo implementations and provides comprehensive ERP solutions\n"
"for businesses in Argentina and Latin America.\n"
"\n"
"To contribute to this module, please visit https://www.adhoc.com.ar.\n"
msgstr ""

